	(text "C88042 has ~25ns propagation delay so\nonly good to 10-15MHz bus\n\nCan also go for:\nSN74F521DWR (C2878464)\nwhich has a 10ns propagation time\n\nC2653336 has 4.5ns propagation time:-)\n\nSwitching at Vcc/2\nMax voltage of Vcc+0.5\n"
